    "note": "<b>Oktane was the last scheduled catalyst on any holding until late October.</b> From here the book has no company events for five weeks, and then three earnings reports and a Fed decision inside four sessions \u2014 Alphabet and the FOMC on the same Wednesday, Apple the next day, Palantir the following Monday. That clustering matters: there is nothing to react to for a month and then everything at once."
